#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:6
msgid "3 Shapes of Sound Rust"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:8
msgid "Functions written only in Safe Rust"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:9
msgid "Functions that contain `unsafe` blocks which are impossible to misuse"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:10
msgid "Unsafe functions that have their safety preconditions documented"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:15
msgid "We want to write sound code."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:16
msgid "Sound code can only have the following shapes:"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:17
msgid "safe functions that contain no unsafe blocks"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:18
msgid ""
"safe functions that completely encapsulate unsafe blocks, meaning that the "
"caller does not need to know about them"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:20
msgid ""
"unsafe functions that contain unsafe blocks but don't encapsulate them, and "
"pass the proof burden to their caller"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:22
msgid "Burden of proof"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:23
msgid "safe functions with only Safe Rust -> compiler"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:24
msgid "safe functions with unsafe blocks -> function author"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/rules-of-the-game/3-shapes-of-sound-rust.md:25
msgid "unsafe functions -> function caller"
msgstr ""
